  "is_folder": false,
  "content": {
    "_uid": "8ed93493-20b1-864d-b950-985ff0867373",
    "body": [
      {
        "_uid": "debec8e1-45da-052b-dd92-6c5c66185bda",
        "content": {
          "type": "doc",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "The Speaking - B1 course focuses on developing speaking skills and provides an opportunity for learners to improve their speaking in a variety of everyday and work-based situations. The course is very interactive with lots of work on improving fluency. Attention is also given to improving the use of pronunciation, grammar and vocabulary when speaking. ",
                  "type": "text"
                },
                {
                  "type": "hard_break"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "The participants gave very positive feedback about these courses. They felt happy with the progress they made and felt more confident about speaking in English:",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "\"I have learnt a lot from this course not only the vocabulary but also the confidence and this course has polished my other skills. I can now fluently speak in English in front of everybody. Before this course I hesitate in speaking English because of my vocabulary but my vocabulary has also been improved ...I have made new friends and know about different departments [at AKU] and how they work.\"",
                  "type": "text"
                },
                {
                  "type": "hard_break"
                },
                {
                  "type": "hard_break"
                },
                {
                  "text": "\"It's the best course to improve our Speaking skills and confidence level\"",
                  "type": "text"
                },
                {
                  "type": "hard_break"
                },
                {
                  "type": "hard_break"
                },
                {
                  "text": "\"Please continue these type of programmes for our learning\"",
                  "type": "text"
                },
                {
                  "type": "hard_break"
                },
                {
                  "type": "hard_break"
                },
                {
                  "text": "For more details about the course, go to the ",
                  "type": "text"
                },
                {
                  "text": "ELE Staff courses",
                  "type": "text",
                  "marks": [
                    {
                      "type": "link",
                      "attrs": {
                        "href": "https://www.aku.edu/ele-net/staff/Pages/Courses.aspx",
                        "uuid": null,
                        "anchor": null,
                        "custom": {},
                        "target": "_blank",
                        "linktype": "url"
                      }
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "text": " page.",
                  "type": "text"
                },
                {
                  "type": "hard_break"
                },
                {
                  "type": "hard_break"
                }
              ]
            }
